Dear John,

As the error message suggests, t.test() doesn't return a vector or matrix --
it returns an object with several elements, one of which (presumably
"statistic") you want to bootstrap. Try

  bootstrap(testdata, t.test(x=testdata$oneten, 
    y=testdata$threethirteen)$statistic, B=100)

I hope that this helps,
 John

